  "rationale": "The plant models robot perception and motion capabilities; the specification enforces safe, coverage-oriented exploration with conservative recovery. Exploration alternates between random_walk and short move_forward pulses in clear states. Obstacle events trigger dedicated turn-recovery states with only one allowed turn direction. Recovery states return to exploration as soon as the path is clear. full_rotate is used only in a deliberate scan state, not as default recovery.",
